.git
.idea/
.vscode/
**/__pycache__/

env/
src/deps/tmp_venv/
tests/
# ...except the Rocky repo files: tests/linux/Dockerfile-{rhel-8,rhel-9,rhel-10,alma-10}
# COPY them and linux-build.yml builds those with `context: .`, so excluding them breaks the
# "Build test image" step. They are NOT the same files as src/linux/rocky-*.repo (baseurl +
# %ARCH% here, mirrorlist + $basearch and excludepkgs tuning there), so pointing the COPY at
# src/linux/ would change what the test images install.
!tests/linux/utils/*.repo
**/Dockerfile
src/common/README*.md
src/common/core/*/README*.md
**/CLAUDE.md
